19bbca7 exp_05 record: every generator protects every file it read
The document guard listed the products, their companions and sidecars, the
approval and each attempt's completion and probe receipt, but not the
train_manifest.json, args.json and history.jsonl `attempt_evidence` reads
directly, and the figure guard only checked the output DIRECTORY, so a
predicted PNG destination hardlinked or symlinked to a canonical JSON
truncated it open.

`attempt_evidence` now names every file it was read from, `protected_inputs`
collects the readers' own lists, and `refuse_overlap` preflights EVERY
concrete destination -- each figure file, not just its directory -- by
resolved path and by device/inode, before anything is written.

